              "exact_quote": "In an open economy, monetary policy affects aggregate demand through two channels: investment reduction and exchange‑rate appreciation."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "CON_0049",
              "exact_quote": "When I increase interest rate from here to there, then my exchange rate has to appreciate."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "CON_0050",
              "exact_quote": "So an expansionary domestic monetary policy will lead to a contraction in output, which is what we get out of monetary policy, but it will also lead to an appreciation of the currency."
